---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { identity } from '../data/identity';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Sky Blu DeGrate | IT Support & Cybersecurity" description="Meet Sky Blu DeGrate: an IT support professional in Brooklyn, CompTIA Security+ certified, documenting Windows, Linux and security investigations as Documentation Princess." pageType="ProfilePage">
  <section class="about-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Operator profile</p>
    <h1>Hi, I’m Sky<br />Blu DeGrate.</h1>
    <p class="intro">IT support. Cybersecurity. Still asking why the computer did that.</p>

    <p>
      I’m an IT support professional based in Brooklyn, New York, with more than five years
      of experience helping people troubleshoot hardware, software, accounts and connectivity.
      My background includes Windows and macOS support, Microsoft 365 and Google Workspace,
      account access, MFA, onboarding and documentation. I earned CompTIA Security+ in February 2026.
    </p>

    <p>
      I’m documenting my path into cybersecurity: the labs I build, the attacks I study,
      the tools I misuse before learning to use them correctly, and the moments AI says
      something with terrifying confidence that turns out to be completely false.
    </p>

    <p>
      This site is part technical portfolio, part field journal, and part evidence that
      persistence occasionally defeats configuration files.
    </p>

    <h2>The work behind the case files</h2>
    <p>
      These are personal labs and training investigations. I build the environment, follow
      the evidence, write down what broke, and distinguish what I observed from what I only
      expected to happen.
    </p>
    <ul class="case-list">
      <li><a href="/case-files/001-windows-is-a-snitch">Wazuh + Sysmon endpoint detection</a><p>Getting a Windows endpoint talking to an Ubuntu-hosted manager, fixing enrollment, and validating a custom detection rule.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/case-files/002-wazuh-knew-the-whole-time">Windows incident investigation</a><p>Connecting process, file, DNS, network and registry events into a timeline, then working out why collected events did not all become alerts.</p></li>
      <li><a href="/case-files/003-the-hacker-forgot-how-cron-works">Linux forensics with LuckyShot</a><p>Reconstructing a Hack The Box training incident through authentication logs, shell history and persistence artifacts. Configured, attempted and observed are different findings.</p></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>There’s a creative side, too.</h2>
    <p>
      My background includes Screen Studies at The New School and software-development
      training at Flatiron School. Film, storytelling and building things for the web are
      part of how I approach technical work: notice the details, understand the sequence,
      and explain what happened clearly.
    </p>
    <p>The name here is Documentation Princess. The person behind it is Sky Blu DeGrate.</p>

    <nav class="profile-links" aria-label="Professional profiles">
      <a href={identity.github} rel="me noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
      <a href={identity.linkedin} rel="me noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a>
      <a href="/#case-files">Read the case files →</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    width: min(920px, calc(100% - 64px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 76px 0 96px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: .92rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 18px 0 36px;
    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    line-height: .88;
    letter-spacing: -.06em;
  }

  .about-page > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 0 30px;
    font-size: clamp(1.08rem, 1.65vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  h2 { margin: 58px 0 22px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  .intro { font-weight: 800; }
  .case-list { padding-left: 24px; max-width: 780px; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.65; }
  .case-list li { margin-bottom: 28px; padding-left: 6px; }
  .case-list a { font-weight: 800; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .case-list p { margin: 8px 0 0; }
  .profile-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 36px; }
  .profile-links a { border: 2px solid var(--ink); background: var(--pink-soft); padding: 12px 16px; box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink); font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
  .profile-links a:hover { background: var(--green); }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .about-page {
      width: min(100% - 36px, 920px);
      padding: 54px 0 72px;
    }

    h1 { font-size: 4rem; }
  }
</style>
